    affiliation: Sardar Patel Institute of Technology
repository-code: 'https://github.com/kevin-doshi/sentinel-z'
url: 'https://github.com/kevin-doshi/sentinel-z'
abstract: >-
  Sentinel-Z is a provenance-based Advanced Persistent Threat (APT)
  detection system that pairs Random-Forest-based anomaly detection
  on graph-behavioral features with a deterministic, signal-driven
  narrative engine that converts detections into SOC-actionable
  natural-language explanations. The system is evaluated on the
  DARPA Transparent Computing Engagement 5 (FiveDirections) dataset
  with rigorous stratified-bootstrap statistics, paired-significance
  testing, ablation studies, and seven independent stress tests
  including shuffled-label leakage controls.
keywords:
